<%- include('partials/head') %>
<div class="container narrow page prose">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account details:</strong> username, email address and a securely hashed password.</li>
    <li><strong>Profile details you choose to add:</strong> bio, phone number, location and photos.</li>
    <li><strong>Content you create:</strong> posts, comments, donation requests, messages and reports.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>2. How we use it</h2>
  <p>Your information is used to run the service: showing your posts, connecting donors with recipients, delivering messages and keeping the platform safe.</p>
  <h2>3. What other members can see</h2>
  <p>Your username, profile and posts are visible to signed-in members. Your email address is never shown. You can hide your profile from the member directory in <a href="/settings">account settings</a>.</p>
  <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use a single essential cookie to keep you signed in. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
  <h2>5. Data protection</h2>
  <p>Passwords are stored only as salted hashes, and all forms are protected against cross-site request forgery.</p>
  <h2>6. Deleting your data</h2>
  <p>You can delete your account at any time from account settings. This permanently removes your profile, posts, comments and messages.</p>
  <p class="muted small">Questions? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
</div>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
